  "title": "ORE-IDA Slow-Cooker Loaded Potato Soup",
  "description": "This ORE-IDA slow-cooker loaded potato soup recipe makes a hearty, rich, and creamy potato soup with Cheddar cheese, hash brown potatoes, and bacon.",
